---
import Base from "../layouts/Base.astro";
import Header from "../components/Header.astro";
import Footer from "../components/Footer.astro";
---

<Base
  title="Accessibility statement | InsurePages"
  description="InsurePages is committed to an accessible web. We design and test this site, and every site we build for clients, to work with a keyboard and a screen reader."
>
  <Header />
  <main id="main" class="statement">
    <div class="container">
      <h1>Accessibility statement</h1>
      <p class="updated">Last updated: September 1, 2026</p>

      <h2>Our commitment</h2>
      <p>
        InsurePages by S3 Labs builds websites for independent insurance
        agents, and we believe those websites should work for everyone. We
        design and test this site, and every site we build for clients, to be
        readable, operable with a keyboard, and usable with a screen reader.
      </p>

      <h2>Measures we take</h2>
      <ul>
        <li>Semantic HTML landmarks, headings, and lists throughout.</li>
        <li>Color contrast checked for text and interactive elements.</li>
        <li>Full keyboard operability with visible focus indicators and a skip link.</li>
        <li>Motion and transitions respect the <code>prefers-reduced-motion</code> setting.</li>
        <li>Automated accessibility scans (axe) run before every release.</li>
      </ul>

      <h2>Known limitations</h2>
      <p>
        Our contact form is provided by Kiwiform, a third-party service, and
        opens in a dialog over the page. If you have difficulty using it, the
        same form is available on its own page at
        <a href="https://share.kiwiform.com/to/ofwodo6p"
          >share.kiwiform.com/to/ofwodo6p</a
        >.
      </p>
      <p>
        Our free tools page at <a href="/tools/">/tools/</a> embeds four tools
        provided by Keywords Everywhere. That content is served from
        keywordseverywhere.com, and we do not control its markup, so we cannot
        vouch for how accessible it is. Nothing loads from them until you
        open a tool. Each tool also links to its own page on
        keywordseverywhere.com, and none of them is required to use this site
        or to work with us. Tell us if you hit a barrier in one and we will
        raise it with them or drop the tool.
      </p>

      <h2>Feedback</h2>
      <p>
        If you encounter an accessibility barrier anywhere on this site, please
        tell us through
        <a href="https://share.kiwiform.com/to/ofwodo6p">our contact form</a>. Include
        the page and a short description of the problem. We aim to respond
        within two business days and to fix verified issues promptly.
      </p>

      <h2>A note on what this means</h2>
      <p>
        Testing lowers your risk and makes the site work better for real
        people. No statement like this one is a legal guarantee. We keep
        testing and improving this site as guidelines and assistive
        technologies evolve.
      </p>
    </div>
  </main>
  <Footer />
</Base>

<style>
  .statement { padding: 80px 0 120px; }
  .statement .container { max-width: 760px; }
  h1 {
    font-family: "Unbounded", sans-serif;
    font-weight: 700;
    font-size: clamp(36px, 5vw, 56px);
    letter-spacing: -0.03em;
    margin-bottom: 8px;
  }
  .updated {
    color: var(--muted);
    font-weight: 600;
    font-size: 14px;
    margin-bottom: 40px;
  }
  h2 {
    font-family: "Unbounded", sans-serif;
    font-weight: 700;
    font-size: 22px;
    letter-spacing: -0.02em;
    margin: 40px 0 12px;
  }
  p, li { font-size: 16px; font-weight: 500; color: #3a3a3a; }
  ul { padding-left: 22px; display: grid; gap: 8px; }
  a { color: var(--ink); font-weight: 700; }
</style>
